   "detailed_description": "<h1>Dragon's Dogma 2: Dark Arisen</h1><p>※本套裝包含的商品亦可單獨購買。請注意避免重複購買。<br><br>【Dragon's Dogma 2: Dark Arisen 內容物】<br>・《Dragon's Dogma 2》本篇遊戲<br>・《Dragon's Dogma 2: Dark Arisen Expansion》<br>・露營用品「探險家的紮營道具套組」<br>・客製化聲音「Dragon's Dogma 聲音套組」<br><br><strong>無人知曉的英雄故事在此等候著你。</strong><br><br>《Dragon's Dogma 2》為玩家帶來響應想像且豐富多彩的動作，<br>以及即使是單人遊玩也能享受「與他人一起冒險的樂趣」的遊戲體驗。<br><br>而《Dragon's Dogma 2: Dark Arisen》就是一款替《Dragon's Dogma 2》添加新故事與體驗的遊戲。<br><br>更易於遊玩，嶄新的冒險，以及更容易入手的價格。<br><br>一同與你的隨從旅伴展開獨一無二的冒險吧。<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■《Dragon's Dogma 2: Dark Arisen》新增內容</h2><strong>①新區域　劇情內容</strong><br>於銀白之地展開的另一段末世錄：「滅盡王土」<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054970/extras/c8da7d536348aae5246ea1417b39421b.avif?t=1791504871\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054970/extras_big/c8da7d536348aae5246ea1417b39421b.avif?t=1791504871 width=1560 height=878 /></span><br>被遺棄的北方領土「諾爾坎」將會成為嶄新的冒險舞台。<br>在此獲得的戰利品可透過「鑑定」找出其真實價值，從而獲得武器與技能等全新能力。<br>覺醒者一行人將與追龍者「艾爾」一同揭開被屍化的不死之龍所隱藏的秘密。<br><br><strong>②本篇區域　挑戰內容</strong><br>挑戰12種不同迷宮：「被忘卻的考驗」<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054970/extras/d3b9ac32bb973d51c02f75737d5eb000.avif?t=1791504871\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054970/extras_big/d3b9ac32bb973d51c02f75737d5eb000.avif?t=1791504871 width=1560 height=878 /></span><br>在這些獨特迷宮的最深處，遺留著歷代覺醒者們曾持有的稀有裝備。<br>為了磨練實力以及獲得至高無上的逸品，接受「引導者」的考驗吧。<br><br><strong>➂編輯角色　新增外觀款式</strong><br>為覺醒者與隨從增添新色彩：「髮型與紋身」<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054970/extras/3661675f5c3624bc6944b564db81a9f7.avif?t=1791504871\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054970/extras_big/3661675f5c3624bc6944b564db81a9f7.avif?t=1791504871 width=1560 height=878 /></span><br>編輯角色功能中新增了更多的髮型與紋身。<br>更加豐富的選擇，讓你更能充分展現覺醒者與隨從的個性。<br>換上嶄新的外觀，在王道幻想世界中展開一段令人興奮的冒險旅程吧。</p><br><h1>關於此遊戲</h1>※本商品的內容亦包含於其他套裝商品內，請注意避免重複購買。<br><br>那段冒險，將被刻為英雄故事。<br><br>能夠響應玩家想像且豐富多彩的動作，<br>以及即使是單人遊玩也能享受「與他人一起冒險的樂趣」的遊戲體驗。<br><br>在繼承了具有獨自遊戲價值的開放世界動作遊戲《Dragon's Dogma 2》中，你可享受想像中的自由冒險。<br><br>借助最新的畫面、物理計算及AI人工智能，<br>精心編織而成的王道幻想世界。<br>這個世界充滿着驚喜和現實感。<br><br>與旅伴隨從一起，<br>讓我們踏入一場獨一無二的冒險吧。<br><br><br><strong><u> 能夠響應玩家想像的動作</u></strong> <br><br>揮劍、拉弓、詠唱咒語。<br>《Dragon's Dogma 2》可讓你在幻想世界的各種職業中，享受想像中的戰鬥。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054970/extras/0f9a604fe67dc8c199a3596f04db4bf9.poster.avif?t=1791504871\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054970/extras/0f9a604fe67dc8c199a3596f04db4bf9.webm?t=1791504871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054970/extras/0f9a604fe67dc8c199a3596f04db4bf9.mp4?t=1791504871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u> 即使單人遊玩也能享受多人遊戲的樂趣</u></strong> <br><br>隨從是由AI控制而獨立行動的。一直共同行動的一名主要隨從，<br>加上經由線上模式借用其他玩家的兩名輔助隨從，<br>玩家可組成最多四人的隊伍。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054970/extras/812d3f6ae4ca14e33d9bf5330b3b9308.poster.avif?t=1791504871\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054970/extras/812d3f6ae4ca14e33d9bf5330b3b9308.webm?t=1791504871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054970/extras/812d3f6ae4ca14e33d9bf5330b3b9308.mp4?t=1791504871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u> 與這個世界棲息的魔物相遇</u></strong> <br><br>當離開城鎮後，將會遇到居住在這片土地上的魔物。 <br>你會選擇迎戰，還是避免對戰？ <br>除了自身的狀態外，還需要看清地形和魔物的各種狀況。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054970/extras/33646709897d3fe2ae188b16b2baac0f.poster.avif?t=1791504871\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054970/extras/33646709897d3fe2ae188b16b2baac0f.webm?t=1791504871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054970/extras/33646709897d3fe2ae188b16b2baac0f.mp4?t=1791504871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u> 與這個世界的居民交流</u></strong> <br><br>旅人，商人和士兵等各色各樣的人都在城鎮和街道上交錯行走。<br>各自有目標和動機的他們，會根據情況表現出不同的表情。<br>有時會向玩家搭訕，發出請求甚至委託任務。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054970/extras/c9e43599a4fcb4bedbab9445f0b3c268.poster.avif?t=1791504871\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054970/extras/c9e43599a4fcb4bedbab9445f0b3c268.webm?t=1791504871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054970/extras/c9e43599a4fcb4bedbab9445f0b3c268.mp4?t=1791504871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
